node_modules/

# Claude connector MCP servers (M16). Their tool annotations (readOnly, destructive, idempotent,
# openWorld) exist only from Metadata API 67.0, and a deploy at this project's sourceApiVersion
# (66.0) silently resets them to false. So the project never deploys them;
# scripts/setup-claude-connector.ps1 does, from a throwaway project at 67.0 (technical log M16.1).
**/mcpServerDefinitions/**
